*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s (400%) spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 0.07~10 seconds<sup>2f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s (600%) spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 0.07~8 seconds<sup>2f~240f</sup>.
